# @agent-k/core

You are in the **domain runtime** cluster (harness, agent loop, config, session/checkpoint, etc.).

## Allowed
- Prompt/harness policy, agent loop control, mode classification
- `ConfigManager` / `ProjectConfig` / `RuntimeServices`
- Prefetch, compaction, verification, memories, telemetry (runtime)

## Forbidden without an explicit cross-cutting task
- Chat React components / CSS
- Settings tab UI (`src/settings/tabs/**`)
- MCP stdio session plumbing (belongs in mcp) unless registering via an interface

## Cycles to avoid
- Do not reintroduce `harness` ↔ `tools` cycles; whitelist/filter should be one-way (harness owns names, tools accepts injected filter).
- Core must not import `src/chat/**`.
